                        "eng": "Let's Mix it Up!",
                        "jpn": null
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "The Mix Masters defeat Root with the Ultimate Guardian. The world finds peace at last. Root tried to create the world in his own image, but finally realizes the story that he knew was only half of the fairy tale. After Root goes back to nature, Core Force spreads around the world, allowing the Mix Masters to return to their normal lives... But the world soon faces another crisis.",
                        "jpn": null
                    },
